{"assets":["/statement-assets/1fe48998f51265ba5e68ac4b153c1a705bccc837eb9801f7be0b940cffce2f07.png","/statement-assets/8174828140537e2e47586f1f336849a396deafb3b2850ef2210e0f44e64eeffb.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"703","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Mishka and trip"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Little Mishka is a great traveller and she visited many countries. After thinking about where to travel this time, she chose XXX — beautiful, but little-known northern country."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here are some interesting facts about XXX:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" XXX consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cities, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" of whose (just imagine!) are capital cities. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" All of cities in the country are beautiful, but each is beautiful in its own way. Beauty value of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th city equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" All the cities are consecutively connected by the roads, including "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-st and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th city, forming a cyclic route "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 — 2 — ... — n — 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". Formally, for every "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i < n"},{"kind":"text","text":" there is a road between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th city, and another one between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"-st and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th city. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Each capital city is connected with each other city directly by the roads. Formally, if city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a capital city, then for every "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ n,  i ≠ x"},{"kind":"text","text":", there is a road between cities "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" road between any two cities. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Price of passing a road directly depends on beauty values of cities it connects. Thus if there is a road between cities "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":", price of passing it equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci·cj"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mishka started to gather her things for a trip, but didn't still decide which route to follow and thus she asked you to help her determine summary price of passing "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"each of the roads"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in XXX. Formally, for every pair of cities "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a < b"},{"kind":"text","text":"), such that there is a road between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" you are to find sum of products "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ca·cb"},{"kind":"text","text":". Will you help her?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3 ≤ n ≤ 100 000, 1 ≤ k ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of cities in XXX and the number of capital cities among them."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1, c2, ..., cn"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci ≤ 10 000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — beauty values of the cities."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of the input contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"id1, id2, ..., idk"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ idi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") — indices of capital cities. Indices are given in ascending order."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the only integer — summary price of passing each of the roads in XXX."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 1\n2 3 1 2\n3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"17"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 2\n3 5 2 2 4\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"71"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This image describes first sample case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1fe48998f51265ba5e68ac4b153c1a705bccc837eb9801f7be0b940cffce2f07.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is easy to see that summary price is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"17"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This image describes second sample case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/8174828140537e2e47586f1f336849a396deafb3b2850ef2210e0f44e64eeffb.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is easy to see that 